            <div xml:id="d451">

                <pb facs="0598" n="486" xml:id="pg486"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/7518: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Second Secretary of Embassy in China</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Atcheson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-12-12T15:00:00+08:00">December 12, 1935—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 12—11:50 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>139. My 137, December 12, noon [<hi rendition="#italic">1 p.m.</hi>] and 138,
                    December 12, 1 [<hi rendition="#italic">2</hi>] p.m. Following additional
                    appointments are understood to have been made this afternoon: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Sung Che-yuan, Hopei Chairman; Chang Tze-chung, Chahar Chairman; Hsiao
                            Chen-ying, Mayor of Tientsin; Shang Chen, Honorary [<hi
                                rendition="#italic">Honan</hi>] Chairman; former Honan Chairman Liu
                            Chih, Pacification Commission[er] for Honan and Anhwei.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Atcheson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
